# Phase 10 — Security Hardening

* **RBAC:** map teams to AAD groups; namespace-scoped roles; least privilege.
* **Policies:** Kyverno/Gatekeeper—mandatory probes, resource requests, non-root, readOnlyRootFS, signed images.
* **Mesh security:** STRICT mTLS; external services via egress gateways & allow-list.
* **Supply chain:** Dependabot/Renovate; container CVE scanning; base image SLAs.

---

# Phase 11 — Decommission & Cost

* **EKS:** drain nodes namespace-by-namespace; snapshot and archive manifests; delete unused ELBs/EBS/ECR repos.
* **Cost controls:** ACR/AKS retention policies, autoscaling profiles, spot pools, Redis/Postgres tier rightsizing after 2 weeks of real traffic.

