## Practical gotchas to watch for

* Header/case sensitivity differences surfacing through APIM; normalize in policies.
* Istio mTLS + health probes: use `PeerAuthentication` PER service if needed to allow kubelet probes or use sidecar-aware probes.
* Client IPs: Cloudflare/APIM add `X-Forwarded-For`; ensure app trusts the right header.
* gRPC & websockets through APIM: verify protocol & timeouts.
* HPA behavior under mesh sidecar: set correct `requests`; avoid CPU throttling.
* Readiness ≠ liveness: keep generous startup probes for JVM/.NET.
* Timeouts: align APIM, Istio, app timeouts (APIM should be ≥ mesh ≥ app).

