## Next steps (suggested sequence)

1. Pick 2 low-risk services; stand up Azure Postgres/Redis (stage), wire Key Vault CSI.
2. Mirror traffic in AKS shadow, then canary via APIM weights.
3. Execute DB cutover for one service using pg\_dump/pg\_restore downtime method.
4. Prove Cloudflare + APIM + Istio path; finalize policies and caching.
5. Scale to remaining services in waves; then decommission EKS.

